        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "OK, I think that adding `zindex` is indeed the most reasonable solution here. Allowing full control over window config might be harmless as allowing full control over window config will also need several adjustments in other places (that also need tests).\r\n\r\nI've merged it in separate branch for to add a few touches. Will merge in `main` soon.",
